t", "note": "《辽史》卷76·张砺传，段落 liaoshi-7cd182a20e67-p005119；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "36f6b4da-d6d1-52e8-81a9-d5a8aef7457e"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·卷281·后晋纪二·天福二年", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "维基文库固定修订1769092；wikitext连续摘录，纸本及版本字形待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a7d3fe25/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0937/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-281-937-collation/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》卷281，维基文库固定修订1769092；连续摘录册命齐王至钱仁俊劝止追究，纸本及版本异文待核。", "id": "10c05e0f-1fa9-5041-9809-c864bfadc60c"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后晋纪二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a7d3fe25/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0937/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-281-937-wuyue/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后晋纪二，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003340；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "23fb5d4f-058c-57b4-8203-01b3b99c9157"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后晋纪二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a7d3fe25/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0937/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-281-937-xi-aftermath/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后晋纪二，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003339；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "62641558-d27b-53aa-8139-7bcf386322eb"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷29·吴峦传", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a7d3fe25/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0937/part-02/sources/library/xinwudaishi-029-wu-luan/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷29·吴峦传，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p001074；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "63f87883-b1ec-5403-b556-43c9535a0aed"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后晋纪二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/bd256224ade10807719cc5b9dd08151101a79e9c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0937/part-01/sources/library/tongjian-281-937-opening/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后晋纪二，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003338；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "d8972aeb-e6f1-58da-b10d-e505fe0b0cfc"}]'::jsonb)
